cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If ceteris gated a comparison in your work, please cite it.
title: ceteris
abstract: Wrap any benchmark; refuse the comparison unless it is valid. Captures the run environment, checks that only declared things differ and that the difference exceeds the noise floor, and issues a verifiable certificate.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Agrawal
    given-names: Anshuman
repository-code: https://github.com/iemAnshuman/ceteris
url: https://github.com/iemAnshuman/ceteris
license: MIT
version: 0.3.0
keywords:
  - benchmarking
  - reproducibility
  - hpc
  - provenance
